OL,3,GNEWSAMan who choked wife unconscious
OL,4,Ajailed for attempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who tried to choke his wife to
OL,7,Fdeath has been jailed for nine years.
OL,9,FMohammed Rumen Ahmed, 47, launched an
OL,10,Fattack on his spouse at the Rockhouse
OL,11,FHotel, in Lossiemouth, Moray, on 11
OL,12,FNovember 2022.
OL,14,FHe repeatedly punched her, threatened
OL,15,Fto kill her and restricted her
OL,16,Fbreathing with her headscarf, which
OL,17,Frendered her unconscious.
